  "description": "This is a set of digital stickers with Christmas gnomes, festive inscriptions, etc. New Year’s attributes. All illustrations are hand-drawn in watercolor. The stickers are ready to print in JPG and PNG formats. Ideal for use on postcards, notebooks, letters, planners, scrapbooking and much more.\nYOU WILL RECEIVE:\n– 14 separate stickers on a transparent background with a white frame (png, 300 dpi ~ 5000×5000 pixels)\n– 1 ready-to-print sheet in JPG format with a white frame and a cut-out line (A4, A5, 300 dpi, 2480×3508 pixels, 1748×2480 pixels)\n– 1 ready-to-print PNG sheet with a white frame on a transparent background (A4, A5, 300 dpi, 2480×3508 pixels, 1748×2480 pixels)\n– 14 PNG individual silhouettes\n– 1 PNG with a set of silhouettes in A4 and A5 format\nThank you for visiting my store and happy creativity!\nFor any questions, please contact me, I will be happy to help you.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This is a set of digital stickers with Christmas gnomes, festive inscriptions, etc. New Year’s attributes. All illustrations are hand-drawn in watercolor. The stickers are ready to print in JPG and PNG formats. Ideal for use on postcards, notebooks, letters, planners, scrapbooking and much more.<br>\nYOU WILL RECEIVE:<br>\n– 14 separate stickers on a transparent background with a white frame (png, 300 dpi ~ 5000×5000 pixels)<br>\n– 1 ready-to-print sheet in JPG format with a white frame and a cut-out line (A4, A5, 300 dpi, 2480×3508 pixels, 1748×2480 pixels)<br>\n– 1 ready-to-print PNG sheet with a white frame on a transparent background (A4, A5, 300 dpi, 2480×3508 pixels, 1748×2480 pixels)<br>\n– 14 PNG individual silhouettes<br>\n– 1 PNG with a set of silhouettes in A4 and A5 format</p>\n<p>Thank you for visiting my store and happy creativity!<br>\nFor any questions, please contact me, I will be happy to help you.</p>",
